WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.850
Here is SpecWithCode,

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:03.610
free in early access.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:04.930
Open Providers.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.170
Select the machine,

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.090
then inspect its native provider and

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:09.090
account state.

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:11.650
Keep credentials on their owning host.

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:14.650
SpecWithCode brings native coding sessions into

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:15.690
one workbench,

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:16.490
with plans,

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:17.210
approvals,

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.570
and checkpoints.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:21.130
SpecWeave keeps task ownership.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.810
Explore the architecture and get

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.410
early access, free,

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:26.970
at spec-weave.com/studio.